cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Learning Hnefatafl: a Copenhagen Hnefatafl engine trained from scratch by self-play"
abstract: >-
  An AlphaZero-style engine for Copenhagen Hnefatafl (11x11): a Rust rules and search core
  and a PyTorch network trained only by self-play, with the records of its matches against
  TaflZero at 15 seconds per move.
authors:
  - family-names: "O'Keefe"
    given-names: "Devin"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-12
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/devinokeefe/hnefatafl"
keywords:
  - hnefatafl
  - tafl
  - self-play
  - reinforcement learning
  - Monte Carlo tree search
